---
config:
  theme: default
title: Job Scraping Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant CronJob
    participant ScraperService
    participant Puppeteer
    participant LinkedIn
    participant Indeed
    participant MongoDB
    participant AlertService
    
    %% Manual Scraping Trigger
    Note over Admin,AlertService: Manual Scraping (Admin)
    Admin->>ScraperService: POST /api/scraper/scrape
    ScraperService->>Puppeteer: Launch headless browser
    Puppeteer-->>ScraperService: Browser instance ready
    
    %% LinkedIn Scraping
    ScraperService->>Puppeteer: Navigate to LinkedIn Jobs
    Puppeteer->>LinkedIn: GET job listings page
    LinkedIn-->>Puppeteer: HTML response
    Puppeteer->>Puppeteer: Extract job cards
    Puppeteer->>Puppeteer: Parse title, company, location, salary
    Puppeteer-->>ScraperService: Return LinkedIn jobs array
    
    %% Indeed Scraping
    ScraperService->>Puppeteer: Navigate to Indeed
    Puppeteer->>Indeed: GET job listings page
    Indeed-->>Puppeteer: HTML response
    Puppeteer->>Puppeteer: Extract job cards
    Puppeteer->>Puppeteer: Parse job details
    Puppeteer-->>ScraperService: Return Indeed jobs array
    
    %% Save to Database
    ScraperService->>ScraperService: Deduplicate jobs by URL
    loop For each new job
        ScraperService->>MongoDB: Check if job exists
        MongoDB-->>ScraperService: Job not found
        ScraperService->>MongoDB: Insert new job document
        MongoDB-->>ScraperService: Job saved with _id
    end
    
    ScraperService->>Puppeteer: Close browser
    Puppeteer-->>ScraperService: Browser closed
    ScraperService->>AlertService: Trigger matching for new jobs
    ScraperService-->>Admin: 200 OK + scraping summary
    
    %% Automated Cron Scraping
    Note over Admin,AlertService: Automated Scraping (Cron)
    CronJob->>CronJob: Every 5 minutes
    CronJob->>ScraperService: Trigger scraping
    ScraperService->>Puppeteer: Launch browser
    Puppeteer-->>ScraperService: Ready
    
    par LinkedIn and Indeed in parallel
        ScraperService->>Puppeteer: Scrape LinkedIn
        Puppeteer->>LinkedIn: Fetch jobs
        LinkedIn-->>Puppeteer: Jobs data
        Puppeteer-->>ScraperService: LinkedIn jobs
    and
        ScraperService->>Puppeteer: Scrape Indeed
        Puppeteer->>Indeed: Fetch jobs
        Indeed-->>Puppeteer: Jobs data
        Puppeteer-->>ScraperService: Indeed jobs
    end
    
    ScraperService->>MongoDB: Bulk insert new jobs
    MongoDB-->>ScraperService: Inserted count
    ScraperService->>AlertService: Notify new jobs available
    AlertService->>AlertService: Start matching process
    ScraperService-->>CronJob: Scraping completed
